; Timing verdicts, which only a quiet host earns: on a loaded one the gate
; reads them inconclusive, exit 0, by contract. These sessions are outside
; @runtest and run with `dune build @quiet` on a quiet host, before a
; release. Each run, the recording of the baseline too, first waits up to
; 60 s for the host to quiet.

(cram
 (runtest_alias false)
 (alias quiet)
 (locks ../measurement)
 (timeout 300)
 (deps ../prelude.sh ../fixture/bench_fixture.exe))
